\n\n</div>\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n[54a]\n\nW B & L (x)--29325--2000-1-5\n\nROYAL BOTANIC GARDENS, KEW\n\n## MEMORANDUM.\n\nSubject\n\nFirst recorded introduction of  $ \\underline{\\text{Heven brasiliensis}} $\n\n\n\nto Kew and from thence to Calcutta.\n\nINWARDS BOOK, 1873, p. 54 :—\n\n\"From India Office, obtained by Mr. Markham from Jas. Collins. Seeds of  $ \\underline{\\text{Hevea}} $, India-rubber tree. Several hundred, about a dozen germinated.\"\n\nThis entry is in Sir Joseph Hooker's writing.\n\nThe note on the germination of the seeds is in Sir W.T.T.\n\nDyer's writing.\n\nOUTWARDS BOOK,1873,p.267:-\n\nSix plants were taken on Sept. 22 in a Wardian Case by Dr. King to Calcutta.\n\nSee also notes in KEW REPORTS, 1873, p.6, 1874, p.6, and 1875, p.7.","images":{"imgs/img_in_image_box_1_1_1098_457.jpg":"https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//2c83ff80-8969-4de6-90df-918e0b31decb/markdown_3/imgs/img_in_image_box_1_1_1098_457.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-31T10%3A11%3A08Z%2F-1%2F%2Fdb4056aa0a47f8e80cd6e240b996f805da7b4c0d7c16b6ea7f84dc14a0e88fb4"}},"outputImages":{"layout_det_res":"https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//2c83ff80-8969-4de6-90df-918e0b31decb/layout_det_res_3.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-31T10%3A11%3A08Z%2F-1%2F%2Fab32db65ed2a2b3f536572718a861da6cfc32e5cf90c76bbfe06e50be102cd6c"},"inputImage":"https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//2c83ff80-8969-4de6-90df-918e0b31decb/input_img_3.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-31T10%3A11%3A08Z%2F-1%2F%2F63b8d28605882415948f7b344525c140f93c45dc656686fd305d539868381319"},{"prunedResult":{"model_settings":{"use_doc_preprocessor":true,"use_layout_detection":true,"use_chart_recognition":true,"use_seal_recognition":true,"use_ocr_for_image_block":true,"format_block_content":true,"m